# ===== server (Linux C++) =====
build/
cmake-build-*/
logs/
*.log
server/loadbot/loadbot

# ===== client (UE5)：只提交源码与工程配置，其余（素材/生成物）全部排除 =====
# 工程在 client/Sightline/ 子目录（两层白名单：先放行子目录，再放行内容）
client/*
!client/README.md
!client/Sightline/
client/Sightline/*
!client/Sightline/Sightline.uproject
!client/Sightline/Source
!client/Sightline/Config
client/Sightline/Source/**
!client/Sightline/Source/**/
!client/Sightline/Source/**/*.cpp
!client/Sightline/Source/**/*.h
!client/Sightline/Source/**/*.cs
client/Sightline/Config/**
!client/Sightline/Config/*.ini

